  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Te Ao: Tuvalu-Australia Partnership on Economic Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports Tuvalu to support fiscal and economic reform (including via the Policy Reform Matrix) and enhance resilience and capacity necessary to maintain a positive growth and development trajectory over the next decade. 
The investment includes funds from the Pacific Direct Financing Fund (PDFF), designed as a regional mechanism to provide budget support to Pacific Island Countries over the next five years.</narrative>
  </description>
